#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:1
msgid "E3024"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:3
msgid ""
"Legacy constructor functions declared inside a `struct` must have name "
"`new`."
msgstr "在 `struct` 内声明的旧式构造函数必须命名为 `new`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:5
msgid ""
"This error happens when a constructor function declared inside a `struct` is"
" not named `new`. This is a legacy syntax diagnostic: renaming the nested "
"function to `new` is not a migration to current syntax. The compiler also "
"rejects nested constructor declarations with E3002; use a top-level "
"constructor instead."
msgstr ""
"当 `struct` 内声明的构造函数未命名为 `new` 时，会出现此错误。这是旧语法诊断：将嵌套函数重命名为 `new` "
"并不等于迁移到现行语法。编译器还会以 E3002 拒绝嵌套构造函数声明；请改用顶层构造函数。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:11
msgid ""
"pub struct S {\n"
"  x : Int32\n"
"  fn constr(x : Int32) -> S\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn S::constr(x : Int32) -> S {\n"
"  { x, }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:19
msgid "Define the constructor with the current top-level `Type::Type` form:"
msgstr "使用现行的顶层 `Type::Type` 形式定义构造函数："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3024.md:19
msgid ""
"pub struct S {\n"
"  x : Int32\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn S::S(x : Int32) -> S {\n"
"  { x, }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn make(x : Int32) -> S {\n"
"  S(x)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
